# Intentionally empty. Cloudreve uses SQLite and an in-memory cache by default and
# requires no secrets at startup. The app's own FQDN is supplied automatically as
# AF_APP_DOMAIN.
#
# NOTE: The first visitor to the web UI registers as the instance administrator.
# This is the same first-user registration window as n8n — there is no env-var-driven
# admin password, so access should be restricted at the network level until the
# administrator account is created.
